{
  "title": "Burn down Ruff boolean-trap ignores",
  "description": "The root Ruff config is suppressing `FBT001`, `FBT002`, and `FBT003` across runtime code and tests. The main buckets are `puppeteer/src/puppeteer/orchestrator.py`, `puppeteer/src/puppeteer/replay.py`, `scripts/export_game.py`, `scripts/migrate_draft_histories.py`, `scripts/tournament_game.py`, and several analysis/toolbox modules.\n\
\n\
Clean these up by converting boolean positional parameters and calls to keyword-only arguments or clearer APIs, then remove the corresponding ignores from `ruff-lint.toml`.\n\
\n\
Relevant files:\n\
- `ruff-lint.toml`\n\
- `puppeteer/src/puppeteer/orchestrator.py`\n\
- `puppeteer/src/puppeteer/replay.py`\n\
- `scripts/export_game.py`\n\
- `scripts/migrate_draft_histories.py`\n\
- `scripts/tournament_game.py`\n\
- `scripts/analysis/toolbox/`",
